# dependencies
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.*
# package-lock.json IS committed on purpose. It was ignored until 2026-08-09 on the
# belief that a macOS-generated lockfile breaks linux native bindings — untrue since
# lockfileVersion 3, which records every platform (verified: all 20 darwin entries
# have linux siblings, and `npm ci` builds green on Vercel). Without it, .npmrc
# save-exact pins direct deps only and every transitive dep floats on each deploy.

